}
```

In this updated code, we added a `perspective` value of 800px to create a 3D space for our element, and set `transform-style` to `preserve-3d`. We also added two `rotate` transforms to tilt the circle in both X and Y directions, giving it a 3D effect. Adjust the values of `perspective`, `transform-style`, and `transform` as needed to achieve the desired 3D effect. You may need to experiment with different values to find what works best for your specific use case.

